Ye'd best ask the right person hereabouts, for I tend to mothers and babes, not beasts in the field. A wolf is a rare sight indeed, so mayhap 'twas a thief or a stray dog that took yer ewe. I can brew a tea for the shock of it, if ye're feeling unsettled by the loss.
